<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-MINALI WINS PARIS-TOURS RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS PARIS-TOURS RACE.</headline>
<dateline>TOURS, France 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the Paris-Tours World Cup race on Sunday.</p>
<p>Belgian Tom Steels was second and Giovanni Lombardi of Italy third.</p>
</text>
